<title>PHILIPPINES: Pure Foods plans fastfood chain.</title>
<headline>Pure Foods plans fastfood chain.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pure Foods Corp, the food subsidiary of Philippine conglomerate Ayala Corp, said on Wednesday its board had approved the incorporation of a fastfood chain.</p>
<p>The company said the new company will be 49 percent owned by Pure Foods.</p>
<p>No other details were available.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
